{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25518","headline":"日暮天无云 · 熊孺登","name":"日暮天无云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"杳杳复苍然，无云日暮天。\n象分青气外，景尽赤霄前。\n渐吐星河色，遥生水木烟。\n从容难附丽，顾步欲澄鲜。\n但见收三素，何能测上玄。\n应非暂呈瑞，不许出山川。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊孺登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25518.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25518","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}